      "content": "Our consortium's steering committee wants a slide on how DNA methylation and gene expression relate in our 70 colon biopsies, and I'd like to show a partial-correlation network linking 150 CpG sites to 250 transcripts. Both tables are sample-by-feature with the same sample IDs and complete numeric values. I'm unsure whether the committee wants one network for all 70 biopsies together or a separate network for each biopsy."
