    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Before I choose a workflow, please tell me:\n- Does the committee want a separate network for each biopsy?\n  You wrote: \"I'm unsure whether the committee wants one network for all 70 biopsies together or a separate network for each biopsy\". LIONESS-DRAGON's contract: \"LIONESS-DRAGON estimates DRAGON's two shrinkage values once on all samples, then derives each sample's network from the all-sample network and the network refitted without that sample\".\n\nNo workflow has been selected and nothing runs before you answer.\n\nNo files were inspected and no analysis ran."
    }
